Backend Nested Support Query Format AstraDB Full <code>{"user.role": {"$eq": "admin"}}</code> PgVector Full <code>{"user.role": {"$eq": "admin"}}</code> ChromaDB Via dot notation <code>{"user.role": {"$eq": "admin"}}</code> (auto-flattened) Milvus Full <code>{"user.role": {"$eq": "admin"}}</code> <p>Example with nested metadata:</p> <pre><code>doc = VectorDocument(
    id="doc-1",
    vector=[...],
    metadata={
        "user": {
            "name": "John",
            "role": "admin",
            "verified": True
        },
        "post": {
            "title": "My Post",
            "stats": {
                "views": 1000,
                "likes": 50
            }
        }
    }
)

# Query nested fields
from crossvector.querydsl.q import Q
results = engine.search(
    "query",
    where=Q(user__role="admin") &amp; Q(post__stats__views__gte=500)
)
</code></pre>
